    <bpmn:process id="W_W5442" name="W5442. Customer Debris Volume &amp; Container Size Estimation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer inquiry at POS/Pro-Desk/online; install/build sale; site survey
Frequency: Per cleanup engagement — ~thousands/yr across install base
Volume: ~thousands of estimates/yr (post-install, project, demolition)
Owner: Site Cleanup Coordinator (Services/VS-12)
Participants: Sales Associate (VS-124), Installation Supervisor (VS-12), customer, Estimation (VS-09.2)
Source: workflow W5442 — Customer Debris Volume &amp; Container Size Estimation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5442_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5442_Lane1" name="Site Cleanup Coordinator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5442_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5442_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5442_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5442_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5442_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5442_Lane2" name="Estimator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5442_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5442_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5442_Start4" name="Customer inquiry at POS/Pro-Desk/online; install/build sale; site survey">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5442_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5442_Task5" name="Gather job parameters: scope (e.g., post-kitchen-reno, post-tile job, full…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Gather job parameters: scope (e.g., post-kitchen-reno, post-tile job, full demolition), material mix (wood/drywall/masonry/metal/packaging), site access (stairs, elevator, parking, hauling distance).
Responsible (R): Site Cleanup Coordinator
Accountable (A): Services Manager
Duration: per job</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5442_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5442_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5442_Task6" name="Estimate debris volume (cubic meters) and weight using standard conversion…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Estimate debris volume (cubic meters) and weight using standard conversion factors per material class; select container/skip size (2/5/10/20 cu.m.) or truck trips.
Responsible (R): Site Cleanup Coordinator
Accountable (A): Services Manager
Duration: per job</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5442_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5442_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5442_Task7" name="For larger/project jobs, schedule a site survey (VS-09.2 takeoff) to validate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: For larger/project jobs, schedule a site survey (VS-09.2 takeoff) to validate; for routine post-install, use channel-standard tables.
Responsible (R): Estimator / Coordinator
Accountable (A): Services Manager
Duration: per large job</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5442_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5442_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5442_Task8" name="Quote price (W5441 catalog + distance/zone) and present options (one-off haul…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Quote price (W5441 catalog + distance/zone) and present options (one-off haul, scheduled multi-haul, skip rental period).
Responsible (R): Site Cleanup Coordinator
Accountable (A): Services Manager
Duration: per job</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5442_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5442_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5442_Task9" name="Document the estimate and assumptions (photos/site sketch for larger jobs) to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Document the estimate and assumptions (photos/site sketch for larger jobs) to support W5448 booking and any post-job dispute.
Responsible (R): Site Cleanup Coordinator
Accountable (A): Services Manager
Duration: per job</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5442_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5442_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5442_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5442_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-803 (ensure controlled execution — Site Cleanup Service Design, Estimation &amp; Crew Scheduling (PA-191.1).) | - operational: estimate accuracy/evidence; quote approval threshold; site survey required above a volume/value threshold.
Owner: Site Cleanup Coordinator (Services/VS-12)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W5442_Assoc12" sourceRef="W5442_Annotation11" targetRef="W5442_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
