    <bpmn:process id="W_W5446" name="W5446. B2B Project &amp; Bulk Debris Engagement, SLA &amp; Quotation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: B2B project award (VS-11/VS-66); developer/contractor/LGU bulk-debris engagement
Frequency: Per B2B project; ~hundreds of project engagements/yr
Volume: B2B project debris from developers/contractors/government — large multi-haul
Owner: Trade/Project Account Manager (VS-11/VS-107)
Participants: Services Manager, Estimator (VS-09.2), Pricing, Legal (VS-100), Customer PM
Source: workflow W5446 — B2B Project &amp; Bulk Debris Engagement, SLA &amp; Quotation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5446_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5446_Lane1" name="Trade">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5446_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5446_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
