        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5446_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5446_End11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5446_Start5" name="B2B project award (VS-11/VS-66); developer/contractor/LGU bulk-debris engagement">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5446_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5446_Task6" name="Engage with the project owner/contractor to scope debris over the project…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Engage with the project owner/contractor to scope debris over the project lifecycle (demolition phase, construction phase, handover) — link to VS-77 material staging and VS-11 project plan.
Responsible (R): Trade/Project Account Mgr
Accountable (A): Services Manager
Duration: per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5446_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5446_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5446_Task7" name="Estimate total debris volume/stream over project phases and design the hauling…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Estimate total debris volume/stream over project phases and design the hauling schedule (recurring multi-haul vs. on-call).
Responsible (R): Estimator / Coordinator
Accountable (A): Services Manager
Duration: per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5446_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5446_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5446_Task8" name="Quote with B2B project pricing (volume tier, dedicated container, SLA…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Quote with B2B project pricing (volume tier, dedicated container, SLA, diversion targets) and contract terms (LGU/DENR liability, indemnity, demurrage).
Responsible (R): Pricing / Legal
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5446_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5446_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5446_Task9" name="Define SLAs (response time, hauling cycle, diversion rate, reporting) and KPIs…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Define SLAs (response time, hauling cycle, diversion rate, reporting) and KPIs for the project term.
Responsible (R): Trade/Project Account Mgr
Accountable (A): Services Manager
Duration: per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5446_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5446_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5446_Task10" name="Book as a project work order with milestone billing (VS-11 W165/W1288 progress…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Book as a project work order with milestone billing (VS-11 W165/W1288 progress billing) and integrate into the project site plan.
Responsible (R): Trade/Project Account Mgr
Accountable (A): Services Manager
Duration: per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5446_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5446_End11" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5446_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5446_Annotation12">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-803: ensure controlled execution — Site Cleanup Service Design, Estimation &amp; Crew Scheduling (PA-191.1).) — project pricing/contract approval; CTL-21 (estimate accuracy; CTL-34 (LGU/DENR liability terms); operational: phase-gated re-estimation on B2B projects.
Owner: Trade/Project Account Manager (VS-11/VS-107)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
