    <bpmn:process id="W_W5447" name="W5447. Subcontractor Hauler &amp; Accredited-Disposer Vendor Onboarding" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Service launch; capacity expansion to a new region; vendor renewal/exit
Frequency: Per vendor onboarding; periodic recertification
Volume: ~10–40 hauling/TSD/landfill/recycler vendors across regions
Owner: Procurement Manager (VS-34/VS-110)
Participants: TPRM (VS-161), Compliance (VS-22), Legal (VS-100), ESG (VS-25), HSE (VS-24)
Source: workflow W5447 — Subcontractor Hauler &amp; Accredited-Disposer Vendor Onboarding</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5447_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5447_Lane1" name="Procurement Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5447_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5447_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5447_Lane2" name="Compliance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5447_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5447_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5447_Lane3" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5447_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5447_Lane4" name="Dispatch Supervisor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5447_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5447_End12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5447_Start6" name="Service launch; capacity expansion to a new region; vendor renewal/exit">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5447_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5447_Task7" name="Qualify hauling subcontractors on LGU hauling permit, DENR transporter…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Qualify hauling subcontractors on LGU hauling permit, DENR transporter registration, vehicle/insurance, and capacity; integrate with VS-110 freight and VS-56 3PL.
Responsible (R): Procurement Manager
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: per vendor</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5447_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5447_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5447_Task8" name="Qualify accredited disposers/recyclers/landfills: DENR-EMB-accredited…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Qualify accredited disposers/recyclers/landfills: DENR-EMB-accredited TSD/MDRF/sanitary landfill, recycler reprocessing accreditation; verify permits (VS-22) and TPRM tier (VS-161).
Responsible (R): Compliance / TPRM
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: per vendor</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5447_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5447_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5447_Task9" name="Contract with waste-stream acceptance terms (clean wood, masonry, metals, mixed…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Contract with waste-stream acceptance terms (clean wood, masonry, metals, mixed C&amp;D), manifest/digital-record obligations, chain-of-custody, and audit rights.
Responsible (R): Legal / Procurement
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: per vendor</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5447_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5447_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5447_Task10" name="Onboard into the dispatch system (W5444) with capacity, region, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Onboard into the dispatch system (W5444) with capacity, region, and acceptance-stream data; define fallback vendors for continuity.
Responsible (R): Dispatch Supervisor
Accountable (A): Services Manager
Duration: per vendor</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5447_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5447_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5447_Task11" name="Periodically recertify permits/accreditation and audit a sample of manifests…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Periodically recertify permits/accreditation and audit a sample of manifests; manage exit/replacement on lapse or performance failure.
Responsible (R): Compliance / TPRM
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5447_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5447_End12" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5447_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5447_Annotation13">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-803: DENR RA 9003/6969 accredited-disposer verification; CTL-803 (TPRM/vendor risk, links to VS-161); CTL-44 (duplicate-invoice/manifest guard); operational: chain-of-custody manifest required for every C&amp;D load.
Owner: Procurement Manager (VS-34/VS-110)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
