    <bpmn:process id="W_W5448" name="W5448. Site Cleanup Service Work Order, Pricing &amp; Booking Confirmation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer accepts estimate (W5442/W5446)
Frequency: Per booking — ~thousands/yr
Volume: Per cleanup engagement
Owner: Site Cleanup Coordinator
Participants: Sales Associate (VS-124), customer, Dispatch (W5444), Finance (VS-15)
Source: workflow W5448 — Site Cleanup Service Work Order, Pricing &amp; Booking Confirmation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5448_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5448_Lane1" name="Site Cleanup Coordinator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5448_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5448_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5448_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5448_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5448_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5448_Lane2" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5448_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5448_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5448_Start4" name="Customer accepts estimate (W5442/W5446)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5448_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5448_Task5" name="Convert the accepted estimate into a service work order: scope…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Convert the accepted estimate into a service work order: scope, container/truck, crew, schedule, price, terms, exclusions.
Responsible (R): Site Cleanup Coordinator
Accountable (A): Services Manager
Duration: per booking</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5448_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5448_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5448_Task6" name="Apply Customer Act (RA 7394) disclosures (service description, price…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Apply Customer Act (RA 7394) disclosures (service description, price, cancellation/refund policy, hazardous exclusion) and capture customer acknowledgment.
Responsible (R): Site Cleanup Coordinator / Legal
Accountable (A): Services Manager
Duration: per booking</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5448_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5448_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5448_Task7" name="Confirm booking with the customer (date/window, access requirements, prep, what…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Confirm booking with the customer (date/window, access requirements, prep, what to expect) via app/SMS/email.
